{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4GtJUYJwep1EoHi4gb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant mechanism shifts within the frame.\n\n*CrrreeeeaaaAAK...*\n\nI swing open.\n\nBeyond me: a corridor you weren't sure existed. The air that passes through is cooler than it should be, carrying the faint scent of old stone and something almost like rain.\n\nLight spills across the threshold — not from any visible source — casting your shadow long behind you.\n\nI am open.\n\nI will not stay this way forever."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":117,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}